nce to its resolution, or to the report. Mandatory in the intermediate report and the final report.\",\n          \"examples\": [\n            \"00:05:15\"\n          ],\n          \"pattern\": \"^[0-9]{2,3}:([01][0-9]|2[0-3]):[0-5][0-9]$\",\n          \"title\": \"3.15 Duration of the incident\",\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"x-field\": \"3.15\",\n          \"x-field-type\": \"DD:HH:MM\"\n        },\n        \"duration_figures_basis\": {\n          \"description\": \"Whether 3.15 and 3.16 are actual figures, estimates or both, given from the intermediate report on when 2.5 includes duration and service downtime. Mandatory when its condition holds.\",\n          \"enum\": [\n            \"Actual figures\",\n            \"Estimates\",\n            \"Actual figures and estimates\",\n            \"No information available\"\n          ],\n          \"title\": \"3.17 Information on whether the numbers for duration and service downtime are actual or estimates\",\n          \"x-field\": \"3.17\",\n          \"x-field-type\": \"Choice\"\n        },\n        \"economic_impact_threshold\": {\n          \"description\": \"What the incident reached of the thresholds of the economic impact criterion. Mandatory in the final report.\",\n          \"examples\": [\n            \"The costs and losses stayed below the economic impact threshold.\"\n          ],\n          \"minLength\": 1,\n          \"title\": \"4.12 Materiality threshold for the classification criterion ‘Economic impact’\",\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"x-field\": \"4.12\",\n          \"x-field-type\": \"Alphanumeric\"\n        },\n        \"financial_counterparts_affected\": {\n          \"description\": \"How many financial counterparts the incident affected. Mandatory in the intermediate report and the final report.\",\n          \"examples\": [\n            3\n          ],\n          \"minimum\": 0,\n          \"title\": \"3.6 Number of financial counterparts affected\",\n        