atory when its condition holds\n3.30\tclient_financial_interest_impact\t3.30 Impact on the financial interest of clients\t\tMandatory in the intermediate report and the final report\n3.31\tother_authorities_informed\t3.31 Reporting to other authorities\t\tMandatory in the intermediate report and the final report\n3.32\tother_authorities\t3.32 Specification of ‘other’ authorities\t\tMandatory when its condition holds\n3.33\ttemporary_actions\t3.33 Temporary actions/measures taken or planned to be taken to recover from the incident\t\tMandatory in the intermediate report and the final report\n3.34\ttemporary_actions_description\t3.34 Description of any temporary actions and measures taken or planned to be taken to recover from the incident\t\tMandatory when its condition holds\n3.35\tindicators_of_compromise\t3.35 Indicators of compromise\t\tMandatory when its condition holds\n4.1\troot_cause_categories\t4.1 High-level classification of root causes of the incident\t\tMandatory in the final report\n4.2\troot_cause_details\t4.2 Detailed classification of root causes of the incident\t\tMandatory in the final report\n4.3\tadditional_root_causes\t4.3 Additional classification of root causes of the incident\t\tMandatory when its condition holds\n4.4\tother_root_causes\t4.4 Other types of root cause types\t\tMandatory when its condition holds\n4.5\troot_cause_information\t4.5 Information about the root causes of the incident\t\tMandatory in the final report\n4.6\tresolution_summary\t4.6 Incident resolution\t\tMandatory in the final report\n4.7\troot_cause_addressed_at\t4.7 Date and time when the incident root cause was addressed\t\tMandatory in the final report\n4.8\tresolved_at\t4.8 Date and time when the incident was resolved\t\tMandatory in the final report\n4.9\tresolution_date_difference\t4.9 Information if the permanent resolution date of the incidents differs from the initially planned implementation date\t\tMandatory in the final report\n4.10\tresolution_risk_assessm